        "heading": "About Us",
        "text": "<p><strong>MOÚV</strong> is a community space and multi-sport store built for athletes, by athletes.</p><p>We’re the starting line and the finish line. A place where runners and cyclists can gear up, roll out, refuel, and come back to connect.</p><p>Inside MOÚV you’ll find curated performance brands: Bandit Running, Chance Running, Balance by Pas Normal Studios, MAAP Cycling, Gobik Sportswear, Alba Optics, Maurten, and Fingerscrossed Socks.</p><p>But MOÚV is more than retail.<br/><br/>We’re also home to Cafe 4L, our in-space cafe in partnership with Cafe Agapita — so athletes can start with coffee, end with recovery, and stay to talk.</p><h3>What we do:</h3><ul><li><strong>Community Hub:</strong> Group runs, group rides, clinics, and athlete meet-ups<br/></li><li><strong>Brand Activation Space:</strong> We host pop-ups, launches, and events for brands — not limited to what we carry in-store. If it moves people, it belongs at MOÚV.<br/></li><li><strong>Athlete-Centered Retail:</strong> Curated gear for running and cycling, focused on quality and performance<br/></li></ul><p><strong>MOÚV is where product, community, and culture meet.</strong></p>",
